                    <p>Trademark assignment is the legal transfer of trademark ownership from assignor to assignee. Under the Trade Marks Act 1999, both registered (Section 38) and unregistered (Section 39) trademarks can be assigned, with or without goodwill. Must be recorded with Trademark Registry via Form TM-P. Until recorded, assignee cannot enforce the trademark. Pune's dynamic business environment - startup acquisitions in Hinjewadi, founder-to-company transfers, franchise assignments, MIDC restructuring - makes this one of the most common IP transactions.</p><div class="table-responsive-wrapper" style="margin-top:16px;"><table><thead><tr><th>Parameter</th><th>Detail</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Legal Basis</td><td>Trade Marks Act 1999, Sections 37-45; Rules 68-74</td></tr><tr><td>Types</td><td>Complete or Partial; With or Without Goodwill</td></tr><tr><td>Registry Filing</td><td>Form TM-P on IP India portal; Rs 9,000/mark (e-filing)</td></tr><tr><td>Jurisdiction</td><td>Trademark Registry Mumbai (for Maharashtra including Pune)</td></tr><tr><td>Stamp Duty</td><td>Maharashtra stamp duty on assignment deed based on consideration</td></tr><tr><td>Timeline</td><td>Registry recording: 2-6 months after Form TM-P filing</td></tr><tr><td>Section 42</td><td>Assignment without goodwill requires advertisement and prescribed conditions</td></tr></tbody></table></div></p>
                </div>
                <p>Pune's 3,200+ startups frequently undergo ownership changes - founders transferring personal trademarks to incorporated companies, Series B acquisitions involving brand portfolio transfers, franchise expansion with territorial rights. IT/SaaS companies in Hinjewadi and Kharadi engage in M&A where trademark value is significant. Learn more about <a href="/trademark-assignment">Trademark Assignment across India</a>.</p>
                <p>Manufacturing companies in Chakan and MIDC transfer trademarks between group entities during restructuring. Without a recorded assignment, the acquiring company cannot enforce trademark rights, file infringement suits, or pass the mark to subsequent buyers. Patron provides complete brand IP management.</p>
                <p>Content is reviewed quarterly for accuracy.</p>
            </div>
