<section class="steps-section" id="procedure-section">
    <div class="section-container">
        <header class="section-header" style="text-align:center;margin-bottom:48px;">
            <span class="section-eyebrow">Our Process</span>
            <h2 class="section-title">How to Assign a Trademark from Pune</h2>
            <p class="section-subtitle" style="text-align:left;max-width:100%;">Filed online on IP India portal. Jurisdictional office: Trademark Registry Mumbai. Maharashtra stamp duty on deed. Bombay HC Pune Bench handles contested assignments. Patron handles all from Wagholi.</p>
        </header>
        <div class="steps-container">
            <div class="step-card"><div class="step-content"><span class="step-badge">Step 1</span><h3 class="step-title">Trademark Due Diligence</h3><p class="step-description">Patron verifies the trademark on IP India portal: registration status, pending applications, oppositions or rectifications, renewal status, existing licenses, and prior assignments in the chain of title. For M&A, extends to the entire portfolio. Issues (expired renewals, pending oppositions, unrecorded transfers) identified and resolved before assignment.</p><div class="step-highlights"><span class="highlight-tag"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><polyline points="20 6 9 17 4 12"/></svg>Registration Verified</span><span class="highlight-tag"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><polyline points="20 6 9 17 4 12"/></svg>Chain of Title Clear</span></div></div><div class="step-visual"><div class="step-illustration"><div class="illustration-icon"><svg viewBox="0 0 120 100" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><rect x="10" y="5" width="100" height="85" rx="6" fill="#F0F4F8" stroke="#14365F" stroke-width="1.5"/><text x="60" y="22" font-size="7" fill="#E8712C" text-anchor="middle" font-family="Arial" font-weight="700">Due Diligence</text><line x1="20" y1="30" x2="100" y2="30" stroke="#14365F" stroke-width="0.8"/><text x="25" y="44" font-size="6" fill="#14365F" font-family="Arial">Registration Status</text><text x="25" y="56" font-size="6" fill="#14365F" font-family="Arial">Chain of Title</text><text x="25" y="68" font-size="6" fill="#14365F" font-family="Arial">Encumbrances</text><path d="M92 42l3 3 6-6" stroke="#10B981" stroke-width="1.5"/><path d="M92 54l3 3 6-6" stroke="#10B981" stroke-width="1.5"/><path d="M92 66l3 3 6-6" stroke="#10B981" stroke-width="1.5"/></svg></div><span class="illustration-label">Diligence Done</span><span class="step-number-large">01</span></div></div></div><div class="step-card"><div class="step-content"><span class="step-badge">Step 2</span><h3 class="step-title">Determine Assignment Type</h3><p class="step-description">Patron advises on structure: complete (all goods/services) or partial (specific classes); with goodwill (business reputation transfers) or without goodwill (mark transfers, business stays - subject to Section 42 conditions). M&A = complete with goodwill. Restructuring = partial possible. Founder-to-company = complete with goodwill.</p><div class="step-highlights"><span class="highlight-tag"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><polyline points="20 6 9 17 4 12"/></svg>Type Selected</span><span class="highlight-tag"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><polyline points="20 6 9 17 4 12"/></svg>S.42 Assessed</span></div></div><div class="step-visual"><div class="step-illustration"><div class="illustration-icon"><svg viewBox="0 0 120 100" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><rect x="10" y="8" width="48" height="75" rx="4" fill="#F0F4F8" stroke="#14365F" stroke-width="1.2"/><rect x="62" y="8" width="48" height="75" rx="4" fill="#F0F4F8" stroke="#14365F" stroke-width="1.2"/><text x="34" y="28" font-size="6" fill="#E8712C" text-anchor="middle" font-family="Arial" font-weight="700">With</text><text x="86" y="28" font-size="6" fill="#E8712C" text-anchor="middle" font-family="Arial" font-weight="700">Without</text><text x="34" y="45" font-size="5" fill="#14365F" text-anchor="middle" font-family="Arial">Goodwill</text><text x="86" y="45" font-size="5" fill="#14365F" text-anchor="middle" font-family="Arial">Goodwill</text><text x="34" y="60" font-size="4" fill="#14365F" text-anchor="middle" font-family="Arial">Brand +</text><text x="34" y="68" font-size="4" fill="#14365F" text-anchor="middle" font-family="Arial">Reputation</text><text x="86" y="60" font-size="4" fill="#14365F" text-anchor="middle" font-family="Arial">S.42</text><text x="86" y="68" font-size="4" fill="#14365F" text-anchor="middle" font-family="Arial">Advertise</text></svg></div><span class="illustration-label">Strategy Set</span><span class="step-number-large">02</span></div></div></div><div class="step-card"><div class="step-content"><span class="step-badge">Step 3</span><h3 class="step-title">Draft and Execute Assignment Deed</h3><p class="step-description">Patron drafts the deed covering: mark identification (registration number, classes), assignor/assignee details, consideration, goodwill status, warranties and indemnities. Executed with witnesses on Maharashtra stamp paper. Related: <a href="/trademark-registration">Trademark Registration</a>.</p><div class="step-highlights"><span class="highlight-tag"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><polyline points="20 6 9 17 4 12"/></svg>Deed Executed</span><span class="highlight-tag"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><polyline points="20 6 9 17 4 12"/></svg>Stamp Duty Paid</span></div></div><div class="step-visual"><div class="step-illustration"><div class="illustration-icon"><svg viewBox="0 0 120 100" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><rect x="15" y="10" width="90" height="70" rx="6" fill="#F0F4F8" stroke="#14365F" stroke-width="1.5"/><text x="60" y="28" font-size="7" fill="#E8712C" text-anchor="middle" font-family="Arial" font-weight="700">Assignment Deed</text><rect x="25" y="38" width="70" height="10" rx="3" fill="#FFF3E0" stroke="#F5A623" stroke-width="0.8"/><text x="60" y="46" font-size="5" fill="#14365F" text-anchor="middle" font-family="Arial">Warranties + Indemnities</text><rect x="25" y="54" width="70" height="10" rx="3" fill="#FFF3E0" stroke="#F5A623" stroke-width="0.8"/><text x="60" y="62" font-size="5" fill="#14365F" text-anchor="middle" font-family="Arial">Maharashtra Stamp Duty</text></svg></div><span class="illustration-label">Deed Ready</span><span class="step-number-large">03</span></div></div></div><div class="step-card"><div class="step-content"><span class="step-badge">Step 4</span><h3 class="step-title">File Form TM-P on IP India Portal</h3><p class="step-description">Form TM-P filed on ipindia.gov.in with executed deed, proof of title, and Rs 9,000 per mark (e-filing). For assignments without goodwill, Section 42 advertising documented. Related: <a href="/brand-copyright-registration">Brand Copyright</a>.</p><div class="step-highlights"><span class="highlight-tag"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><polyline points="20 6 9 17 4 12"/></svg>TM-P Filed</span><span class="highlight-tag"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><polyline points="20 6 9 17 4 12"/></svg>Rs 9,000 Paid</span></div></div><div class="step-visual"><div class="step-illustration"><div class="illustration-icon"><svg viewBox="0 0 120 100" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><rect x="15" y="10" width="90" height="70" rx="6" fill="#F0F4F8" stroke="#14365F" stroke-width="1.5"/><text x="60" y="25" font-size="7" fill="#E8712C" text-anchor="middle" font-family="Arial" font-weight="700">Form TM-P Filed</text><rect x="25" y="35" width="70" height="14" rx="4" fill="#FFF3E0" stroke="#F5A623" stroke-width="0.8"/><text x="60" y="45" font-size="5" fill="#14365F" text-anchor="middle" font-family="Arial">IP India Portal</text><rect x="25" y="56" width="70" height="14" rx="4" fill="#10B981" opacity="0.15"/><text x="60" y="66" font-size="6" fill="#10B981" text-anchor="middle" font-family="Arial" font-weight="600">Rs 9,000/Mark</text></svg></div><span class="illustration-label">Application Submitted</span><span class="step-number-large">04</span></div></div></div><div class="step-card"><div class="step-content"><span class="step-badge">Step 5</span><h3 class="step-title">Registry Recording</h3><p class="step-description">Trademark Registry Mumbai (jurisdiction for Maharashtra/Pune) examines the Form TM-P. If documents are in order, Registry records the assignment and updates the register to reflect the new proprietor. Takes 2-6 months. Patron follows up and responds to objections or queries.</p><div class="step-highlights"><span class="highlight-tag"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><polyline points="20 6 9 17 4 12"/></svg>Assignment Recorded</span><span class="highlight-tag"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><polyline points="20 6 9 17 4 12"/></svg>New Owner on Register</span></div></div><div class="step-visual"><div class="step-illustration"><div class="illustration-icon"><svg viewBox="0 0 120 100" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><rect x="20" y="12" width="80" height="35" rx="4" fill="#10B981" opacity="0.15"/><text x="60" y="33" font-size="8" fill="#10B981" text-anchor="middle" font-family="Arial" font-weight="700">Recorded</text><rect x="25" y="58" width="70" height="25" rx="4" fill="#FFF3E0" stroke="#F5A623" stroke-width="0.8"/><text x="60" y="68" font-size="6" fill="#14365F" text-anchor="middle" font-family="Arial">TM Registry Mumbai</text><text x="60" y="78" font-size="5" fill="#E8712C" text-anchor="middle" font-family="Arial" font-weight="600">2-6 Months</text></svg></div><span class="illustration-label">Transfer Complete</span><span class="step-number-large">05</span></div></div></div><div class="step-card"><div class="step-content"><span class="step-badge">Step 6</span><h3 class="step-title">Post-Assignment Updates</h3><p class="step-description">Certificate updated to reflect new owner. Associated IP transferred: <a href="/logo-copyright-registration">logo copyright</a>, domain names. Licensing agreements updated. Renewal calendar set up via <a href="/zoho-books-accounting">Zoho Books</a>. Brand assets and packaging updated.</p><div class="step-highlights"><span class="highlight-tag"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><polyline points="20 6 9 17 4 12"/></svg>IP Portfolio Updated</span><span class="highlight-tag"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><polyline points="20 6 9 17 4 12"/></svg>Renewal Calendar Set</span></div></div><div class="step-visual"><div class="step-illustration"><div class="illustration-icon"><svg viewBox="0 0 120 100" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><rect x="5" y="15" width="35" height="55" rx="4" fill="#F0F4F8" stroke="#14365F" stroke-width="1.2"/><rect x="43" y="15" width="35" height="55" rx="4" fill="#F0F4F8" stroke="#14365F" stroke-width="1.2"/><rect x="81" y="15" width="34" height="55" rx="4" fill="#F0F4F8" stroke="#14365F" stroke-width="1.2"/><text x="22" y="35" font-size="5" fill="#E8712C" text-anchor="middle" font-family="Arial" font-weight="600">Cert</text><text x="60" y="35" font-size="5" fill="#E8712C" text-anchor="middle" font-family="Arial" font-weight="600">Logo &#169;</text><text x="98" y="35" font-size="5" fill="#E8712C" text-anchor="middle" font-family="Arial" font-weight="600">Domain</text><text x="22" y="52" font-size="4" fill="#14365F" text-anchor="middle" font-family="Arial">Updated</text><text x="60" y="52" font-size="4" fill="#14365F" text-anchor="middle" font-family="Arial">Transferred</text><text x="98" y="52" font-size="4" fill="#14365F" text-anchor="middle" font-family="Arial">Moved</text></svg></div><span class="illustration-label">Fully Transferred</span><span class="step-number-large">06</span></div></div></div>

