                        <tr><td>Founder's TM Not Transferred</td><td>Most common issue - founder registered TM personally, never transferred to Pvt Ltd. Flagged during VC due diligence</td><td>Proactively identified during compliance reviews. Assignment executed immediately</td></tr><tr><td>Assignment Not Recorded</td><td>Deed executed but Form TM-P not filed. Assignee cannot enforce, renew, or pass the mark</td><td>Every assignment recorded with Registry. Form TM-P filed within days of deed execution</td></tr><tr><td>Partial Assignment Conflicts (S.40)</td><td>Transferring some goods/services may create conflicting exclusive rights in multiple persons</td><td>Portfolio and goods/services scope evaluated before advising partial vs complete</td></tr><tr><td>No Advertisement for Without Goodwill</td><td>Section 42 requires advertisement. Non-compliance = Registry refusal to record</td><td>Section 42 conditions verified and advertising arranged before filing</td></tr><tr><td>Maharashtra Stamp Duty Missing</td><td>Deed on plain paper = inadmissible in court. Stamp duty based on consideration value</td><td>Deed executed on proper stamp paper/e-stamp. Duty paid before filing</td></tr>

